{"version":1,"key":"card:633","content":{"id":633,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"for ... in","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的作用是遍历对象上","type":"formatted"},{"color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff","text":"可枚举","type":"formatted"},{"text":"的属性，包括原型链上的属性","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d492dba3-b38d-434a-90cc-9badc7747df3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const animal = {\n  type: '哺乳动物',\n  eat: function() {\n    console.log('正在吃东西...');\n  }\n};\n\nconst dog = Object.create(animal);\ndog.name = '旺财';\ndog.breed = '哈士奇';\n\nconsole.log(\"\\n遍历 dog 对象（包含原型链）:\");\nfor (let key in dog) {\n  console.log(`找到属性: ${key}`);\n}","collabId":"44056b06-f6cd-4683-9374-d16da548362b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0514eedf-d553-4acc-be4d-f3cae4f71e62","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"de765087-5619-41ae-8838-6d23b448faad"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"遍历 dog 对象（包含原型链）:\n找到属性: name\n找到属性: breed\n找到属性: type      // <-- 来自原型 animal\n找到属性: eat       // <-- 来自原型 animal","collabId":"ccdcbe56-7da5-42b8-add9-73c17713a9b5","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"385ae28a-cafc-4cc2-9696-d7f08bd2336b","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"f353a31a-d3ca-4837-8fbc-9a56e7c0918b"},{"calloutType":"tip","children":[{"children":[{"text":"可以使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"hasOwnProperty","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来过滤原型上的属性。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b361ce9b-3491-44b9-a39c-7fba54b94b99","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b04